tigervnc: tigervnc (a high-speed version of VNC)
tigervnc:
tigervnc: Virtual Network Computing (VNC) is a remote display system which 
tigervnc: allows you toview and interact with a virtual desktop environment
tigervnc: that is running on another computer on the network. 
tigervnc:
tigervnc: TigerVNC is a high-speed version of VNC based on the RealVNC 4 and
tigervnc: X.org code bases. TigerVNC supports a variant of Tight encoding
tigervnc: that is greatly accelerated by the use of the libjpeg-turbo JPEG 
tigervnc: codec.
